    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assuma um local decadente e abandonado e transforme-o na boate mais popular do pa\u00eds. Nesta aventura, os jogadores ir\u00e3o reformar, melhorar e expandir cada canto do espa\u00e7o para alcan\u00e7ar o auge da vida noturna. Mas n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 f\u00e1cil; voc\u00ea precisar\u00e1 gerenciar clientes problem\u00e1ticos e, ao mesmo tempo, manter a reputa\u00e7\u00e3o do clube. Este jogo n\u00e3o \u00e9 apenas um simulador de boate; \u00e9 uma jornada de estrat\u00e9gia, criatividade e caos que voc\u00ea vivenciar\u00e1 com seus amigos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desde o design do local at\u00e9 os relacionamentos com os clientes, oferecemos uma atmosfera din\u00e2mica que o mergulha no caos e na empolga\u00e7\u00e3o da vida noturna. Crie o estilo e a atmosfera do seu pr\u00f3prio clube, personalize seu espa\u00e7o e deixe sua marca na cena da vida noturna. Quer voc\u00ea queira decorar sua boate com um design moderno ou adicionar um toque de nostalgia, a escolha \u00e9 totalmente sua!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/0665c45ec6ecad5c2ce9d32b1b0c0ecf.webp?t=1753903448\" width=174 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Os melhores gr\u00e1ficos do g\u00eanero de simula\u00e7\u00e3o cooperativa que voc\u00ea j\u00e1 jogou. Desenvolvido com Unreal Engine 5.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/539faac9578832bce0bd5188d9c54bfb.poster.avif?t=1753903448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/539faac9578832bce0bd5188d9c54bfb.webm?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/539faac9578832bce0bd5188d9c54bfb.mp4?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/4aaa3ffbd3807821cae686b35545c5a9.webp?t=1753903448\" width=347 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comportamentos din\u00e2micos de IA dos clientes e eventos espont\u00e2neos para uma experi\u00eancia mais imersiva.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/81bd0deb40ef3096cdd511759e60923d.poster.avif?t=1753903448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/81bd0deb40ef3096cdd511759e60923d.webm?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/81bd0deb40ef3096cdd511759e60923d.mp4?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/f00892cdf7ad2e8a3c2ac9a29c8a2fc8.webp?t=1753903448\" width=224 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aumente o prest\u00edgio e a satisfa\u00e7\u00e3o dos clientes do clube adicionando recursos como strippers, m\u00e1quinas de preservativos e outros servi\u00e7os premium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/e59346fef844c0e63d6bf0d25f4430ce.poster.avif?t=1753903448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/e59346fef844c0e63d6bf0d25f4430ce.webm?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/e59346fef844c0e63d6bf0d25f4430ce.mp4?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/743b3af9324c7f1109afd112ecc9b1aa.webp?t=1753903448\" width=301 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gerencie quem entra e cobre taxas de entrada para manter o controle e maximizar os lucros na porta.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/947860ef8401802fc17b61aa972e87fb.poster.avif?t=1753903448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/947860ef8401802fc17b61aa972e87fb.webm?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/947860ef8401802fc17b61aa972e87fb.mp4?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/070fff21f58721a060b8669cebcb0a86.webp?t=1753903448\" width=183 height=32 /></span><strong>Leve sua boate ao pr\u00f3ximo n\u00edvel com seus amigos e se torne o melhor da cidade!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/c23fba4cda17cc3c7b94f63accd9e10e.poster.avif?t=1753903448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/c23fba4cda17cc3c7b94f63accd9e10e.webm?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943670/extras/c23fba4cda17cc3c7b94f63accd9e10e.mp4?t=1753903448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
